./" Manpage for brightness
.TH man 1 "17 Dec 2025" "1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
	brightess - brightness change tool
.SH SYNOPSIS 
	brightness [-r | -c <change> ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
	Allows you to change or reset brightness, and synchronizes brightness between displays
.SH OPTIONS
	-r to reset to default brightness (1)
.br
	-c <change> to change the brightness to <current brightness> + change.  Change can be negative to decrease the brightness
.SH EXAMPLES
	brightness -r
.br
	brightness -c -0.1
.br
	brightness -c 0.3
.SH BUGS
	undefined behavior if no arg is provided
